<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Iwai's shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Iwai's shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Iwai's International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the apparel retailer rose HK$0.17 or 9.34 percent to HK$1.99 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
